{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "BSB",
  "book_code": "1CH",
  "chapter": 8,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Benjamin was the father of Bela his firstborn, Ashbel the second, Aharah the third,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Nohah the fourth, and Rapha the fifth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The sons of Bela: Addar, Gera, Abihud,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Abishua, Naaman, Ahoah,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Gera, Shephuphan, and Huram.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These were the descendants of Ehud who were the heads of the families living in Geba and were exiled to Manahath:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Naaman, Ahijah, and Gera, who carried them into exile and who was the father of Uzza and Ahihud.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Shaharaim had sons in the country of Moab after he had divorced his wives Hushim and Baara.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "His sons by his wife Hodesh: Jobab, Zibia, Mesha, Malcam,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jeuz, Sachia, and Mirmah. These were his sons, heads of families.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He also had sons by Hushim: Abitub and Elpaal.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The sons of Elpaal: Eber, Misham, Shemed (who built Ono and Lod with its villages),",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "and Beriah and Shema (who were the heads of families living in Aijalon and who drove out the inhabitants of Gath).",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ahio, Shashak, Jeremoth,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Zebadiah, Arad, Eder,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Michael, Ishpah, and Joha were the sons of Beriah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Zebadiah, Meshullam, Hizki, Heber,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ishmerai, Izliah, and Jobab were the sons of Elpaal.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jakim, Zichri, Zabdi,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Elienai, Zillethai, Eliel,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Adaiah, Beraiah, and Shimrath were the sons of Shimei.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ishpan, Eber, Eliel,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Abdon, Zichri, Hanan,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hananiah, Elam, Anthothijah,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Iphdeiah, and Penuel were the sons of Shashak.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Shamsherai, Shehariah, Athaliah,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jaareshiah, Elijah, and Zichri were the sons of Jeroham.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "All these were heads of families, the chiefs according to their genealogies, and they lived in Jerusalem.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jeiel the father of Gibeon lived in Gibeon. His wife’s name was Maacah,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "and Abdon was his firstborn son, then Zur, Kish, Baal, Nadab,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Gedor, Ahio, Zecher,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "and Mikloth, who was the father of Shimeah. They too lived alongside their relatives in Jerusalem.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ner was the father of Kish, Kish was the father of Saul, and Saul was the father of Jonathan, Malchishua, Abinadab, and Esh-baal.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.34",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.34",
      "verse": 34,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The son of Jonathan: Merib-baal, and Merib-baal was the father of Micah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.35",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.35",
      "verse": 35,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The sons of Micah: Pithon, Melech, Tarea, and Ahaz.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.36",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.36",
      "verse": 36,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ahaz was the father of Jehoaddah, Jehoaddah was the father of Alemeth, Azmaveth, and Zimri, and Zimri was the father of Moza.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.37",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.37",
      "verse": 37,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Moza was the father of Binea. Raphah was his son, Eleasah his son, and Azel his son.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.38",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.38",
      "verse": 38,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Azel had six sons, and these were their names: Azrikam, Bocheru, Ishmael, Sheariah, Obadiah, and Hanan. All these were the sons of Azel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.39",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.39",
      "verse": 39,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The sons of his brother Eshek: Ulam was his firstborn, Jeush second, and Eliphelet third.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.40",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.8.40",
      "verse": 40,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The sons of Ulam were mighty men of valor, archers, and they had many sons and grandsons— 150 in all. All these were the descendants of Benjamin.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
